        "body": "@aahlenst wrote in https://code.forgejo.org/forgejo/runner/issues/1788#issuecomment-106305:\r\n\r\n> Thanks for the report, @franke.\r\n> \r\n> Forgejo Runner does the equivalent of `docker exec` to run a single command, for example, your tests. I'd expect the result that you are considering a bug, unless I'm missing something, which is possible, because the reproducer is rather involved.\r\n> \r\n> I'm a bit confused by your list of Forgejo Runner versions. Does that mean it worked with previous versions?\r\n\r\nI don't know if it worked with previous versions, I just tried these both, because in our system we have the v13.2.0 and I tried the newer one also to see if it was fixed there."
